# Project Overview
This repository contains a microservice architecture research project, primarily focusing on `pika-flow` located in `microservice/pika-flow`.
It is an Nx monorepo using NestJS for backend services.

## Architecture
- **Monorepo Tool**: Nx
- **Framework**: NestJS
- **Communication**, RabbitMQ (via `amqp-connection-manager` / `amqplib`)
- **Database**: 
    - MongoDB (via Mongoose)
    - Redis (via `ioredis` / `redis`)

## Structure (`microservice/pika-flow`)
### Apps
- **gateway**: Entry point/API Gateway.
- **crawler**: Service responsible for crawling data (using `axios`, `cheerio`, `rss-parser`).
- **processor**: Service responsible for processing data.

### Libs
- **common**: Shared utilities and code, aliased as `@app/common`.

## Technology Stack
- **Language**: TypeScript (NodeNext module resolution)
- **Package Manager**: pnpm
- **Key Libraries**:
    - `@nestjs/microservices`: For microservice communication.
    - `cheerio`: For HTML parsing.
    - `rss-parser`: For RSS feed parsing.
    - `rxjs`: For reactive programming.

## Code Style & Conventions
- **Formatting**:
    - **Quotes**: Single quotes (`'`).
    - **Semicolons**: Included (standard TS).
    - **Indentation**: 2 spaces (standard Prettier default, though .prettierrc only explicitly sets quotes).
- **Naming**:
    - **Files**: `kebab-case` (e.g., `app.module.ts`, `header.tsx`).
    - **Directories**: `kebab-case` (e.g., `blog-shell`, `knowledge-graph`).
    - **Classes/Components**: `PascalCase` (e.g., `AppModule`, `Header`).
- **Structure**:
    - **NestJS**: Modules -> Controllers -> Services.
    - **Next.js**: App Router (`src/app`), Atomic Design-ish (`src/components/ui` vs features).
- **Path Aliases**: 
    - `@app/common/*` -> `libs/common/src/*` (NestJS)
    - Standard Next.js aliases (likely `@/*` -> `src/*` - inferred from typical setup).
- **Configuration Files**:
    - `tsconfig.base.json`: Base TypeScript config.
    - `nx.json`: Nx task runner config.
    - `eslint.config.mjs`: Flat config for ESLint (Nx presets).
    - `docker-compose.yml`: Local infrastructure (RabbitMQ, Redis, Mongo).

## Common Commands
- **Serve App**: `npx nx serve <app-name>` (e.g., `npx nx serve gateway`)
- **Build**: `npx nx build <app-name>`
- **Lint**: `npx nx lint <app-name>`
- **Test**: `npx nx test <app-name>`

## Structure (packages/blog-shell)
**Type**: Next.js 15 App (Frontend)

### Technology Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 15, React 19
- **Styling**: TailwindCSS v4
- **Content**: Contentlayer2, Keystatic (CMS)
- **UI**: Radix UI, Lucide React
- **i18n**: next-intl

### Commands
- **Dev**: `pnpm dev` (Port 5006)
- **Build**: `pnpm build`
- **Start**: `pnpm start` (Port 5006)
- **Type Check**: `pnpm type-check`
